37	// registry exists yet. Whatever step fails, batch-import must report failure
38	// to its caller: non-zero exit code, stderr naming the target registry path
39	// and the concrete save reason, empty stdout, the existing registry kept
40	// byte-for-byte and timestamp-for-timestamp (or the missing target still
41	// absent), no partial table and no leftover temporary file, and the
42	// read-only manifest exactly as submitted. Success controls with the very
43	// same manifest prove the manifest imports normally and that the JSON results
44	// match what the registry finally holds, record by record and field by field.
